[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099229989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108847#issuecomment-3099229989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108847","id":3099229989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64un8l","user":{"login":"natstott","id":59363512,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MzYzNTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59363512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott","html_url":"https://github.com/natstott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T21:37:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T22:35:05Z","body":"A workaround that functions ok, also suggested by MrCDK is:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc Get_Planet(planetid):\n\tvar stride = 80 #20*4 bytes as using custom and color\n\tvar rd = RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\n\tvar buffer_rid = RenderingServer.multimesh_get_buffer_rd_rid(planet_Multimesh) \n\tvar main_rd = RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\n\tvar buffer = main_rd.buffer_get_data(buffer_rid,planetid*stride,stride).to_float32_array()\n\t\t# parse the buffer data\n\tvar thisposition = Vector3(buffer.get(3), buffer.get(7),buffer.get(11))# based on transform buffer in multimesh\n\treturn thisposition\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3099229989/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239429599","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108847#issuecomment-3239429599","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108847","id":3239429599,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BFcXf","user":{"login":"natstott","id":59363512,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MzYzNTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59363512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott","html_url":"https://github.com/natstott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natstott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T17:56:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T17:56:40Z","body":"Clayjohn, you have marked this as a documentation issue, are you saying that the get_transform is intended to always retrieve the local cached version and this just needs explaining?\n\nI have to admit, I wouldn't be using the multimesh buffer for this purpose if there was a way to call a multimesh draw using a storage buffer to update positions. Perhaps I should be using particles?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.git